Key Difference from concatMap
concatMap (Sequential): Subscribes to one inner Observable at a time, waiting for each to complete before starting the next. Total time: ~5 seconds.

mergeMap (Parallel): Subscribes to all 5 inner Observables immediately at the same time. Since each has a 1-second delay running concurrently, all 5 complete and emit around the same 1-second mark. Total time: ~1 second.






